          "sender": "me",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "bin mir nicht sicher ob das echt so notwendig ist",
          "textEn": "not sure that's really necessary",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-11T10:46",
          "sender": "me",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hast du eigentlich das Kindergeld für diesen Monat schon?",
          "textEn": "Have you actually got this month's child benefit yet?",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-11T10:47",
          "sender": "me",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "ist gerade echt knapp bei mir",
          "textEn": "things are really tight for me right now",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-11T10:48",
          "sender": "me",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ich hab jetzt ein neues Fernglas. Das war aber teurer als gedacht.",
          "textEn": "I've got new binoculars now. They were pricier than I thought though.",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-12T10:48",
          "sender": "",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "Der Sohn von den Abeles lungert immer am Waldrand rum.",
          "textEn": "The Abeles' son is always loitering at the edge of the woods.",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-12T10:49",
          "sender": "",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "lass doch mal die Abeles in ruhe",
          "textEn": "just leave the Abeles alone",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-12T12:49",
          "sender": "me",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "hast du das Geld jetzt wirklich fürn Fernrohr ausgegeben??",
          "textEn": "did you really spend the money on a telescope??",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-13T08:49",
          "sender": "me",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "Mama??",
          "textEn": "Mum??",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-14T12:49",
          "sender": "me",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "Die letzten drei Tage sind sie immer früh aus dem Haus gegangen.",
          "textEn": "The last three days they've left the house early every time.",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-17T12:49",
          "sender": "",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohne zu frühstücken!!",
          "textEn": "Without any breakfast!!",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-17T12:50",
          "sender": "",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "ist doch egal",
          "textEn": "who cares",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-17T14:50",
          "sender": "me",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "Wer nicht frühstückt der führt was im Schilde",
          "textEn": "Anyone who skips breakfast is up to something",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-17T17:50",
          "sender": "",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "und wegen dem Geld?",
          "textEn": "and what about the money?",
