          "sender": "me",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "hab echt nix mehr",
          "textEn": "I've really got nothing left",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-17T18:51",
          "sender": "me",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ich hab dir was überwiesen.",
          "textEn": "I've transferred you something.",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-17T20:51",
          "sender": "",
          "status": "read"
        },
        {
          "text": "Der Sohn läuft seit drei Tagen nur in Gummistiefeln rum.",
